@startuml
left to right direction
actor Visitor
actor "B2B Client" as Client
actor "Managerial Analyst" as Analyst
actor "Super Admin" as Admin
actor "Assigned Reviewer" as Reviewer
actor "Assigned Publisher" as Publisher
rectangle "P4I Spatial Analytics" {
 usecase "Browse catalog / metadata / help" as Browse
 usecase "Compose map / inspect pixel" as Map
 usecase "Configure and execute bounded analysis" as Analysis
 usecase "Approve exact expensive job\nwhen adapter is available" as Cost
 usecase "Prepare draft deliverable" as Draft
 usecase "Request revision / approve exact revision" as Review
 usecase "Release to entitled client\n(DEMO simulation today)" as Release
 usecase "Read/download entitled published revision" as Download
 usecase "Manage users / entitlements / audit" as Manage
}
Visitor --> Browse
Visitor --> Map : public/demo
Client --> Map : entitlement
Client --> Download
Analyst --> Analysis
Analyst --> Draft
Analyst --> Cost
Reviewer --> Review
Publisher --> Release
Admin --> Manage
note bottom of Admin
Admin does not imply reviewer qualification.
AI has no reviewer/publisher/cost-approval role.
end note
@enduml
